# Count on Luck: "You may play that card this turn" (CR 305.2, 116.2a): a land it exiles may be played from exile, and playing it
# is the turn's land play. Cast on turn 1 off Black Lotus; Bot1's turn-3 upkeep exiles a Plains, which Bot1 plays from exile, after which
# the Island in hand cannot be played that turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Count on Luck
Black Lotus
Mountain
Island x4
Plains
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Count on Luck.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Exile = Plains
Bot1.Exile.Plains.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Island.Play

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Tapped = false
